  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV and AIDS Community Care Programme (including Development Board support)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to contribute towards combating the spread of AIDS and HIV and assisting people living with AIDS and HIV (PLWHA) in communities around Mpongwe District, Zambia. It aims to do this by providing holistic care to chronically ill, orphans and HIV and AIDS patients, and provide accessible voluntary counselling services to communities. As well as influencing change in cultural practices and attitudes that discriminate and stigmatised people affected and infected. In addition, the programme is taking on an additional responsibility of addressing stigma.</narrative>
  </description>
